    "content": "📌 PHYSICS\n• Vector & Calculus, Units & Measurement, Motion in a Straight line, Projectile motion, Relative motion, Newton law of Motion, Friction, Work, Power & Energy, Circular motion, Motion of System of Particle and COM, Rotational Motion, Mechanical Properties of Solids, Mechanical Properties of Fluids, Thermal Properties of Matter, Kinetic Theory of Gases and Thermodynamics, Simple Harmonic Motion, Waves, Electric charges and field, Electrostatic potential and Capacitance, Gravitation, Current Electricity, Moving Charges and Magnetism, Magnetism and Matter, Electromagnetic Induction\n\n📌 CHEMISTRY\n• Some Basic Concepts of Chemistry, Redox reactions, Atomic structure, IUPAC Nomenclature, Thermodynamics, Isomerism, General Organic Chemistry, HYDROCARBON, Alkyl halides and Aryl halides, Alcohol Phenol and Ether, Equilibrium, Solutions, Aldehydes, Ketones and Carboxylic acids, Organic compounds containing nitrogen, Classification of elements and periodicity in properties, Chemical kinetics, Chemical bonding and molecular structure\n\n📌 MATHEMATICS\n• Basic Math & Logarithm, Quadratic Equations, Sequence & Series, Binomial Theorem, Trigonometric Ratio & Identities, Straight Lines, Circle, Parabola, Ellipse, Hyperbola, Vector Algebra, Three Dimensional Geometry, Set Theory, Relations & Functions, Inverse Trigonometric Functions, Limit of Functions, Continuity & Differentiability, MOD, Application of Derivatives, Determinants, Matrices"
  }
